        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "As we continue to scale our manufacturing process and capabilities around the advancement of our SAB-142 program, we will begin expanding our manufacturing footprint and adding manufacturing redundancy with a Contract Development and Manufacturing Organization (CDMO) for producing late-stage clinical drug supply and commercial drug product.",
        "start_character": 40002,
