        "filing_date": "2026-03-09",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "Since acquiring the technology in 2014, we have continued to develop intellectual property and specifically targeted hIgG to multiple disease indications, and we have conducted or collaborated in eight clinical trials (six of which are in review), where we have demonstrated safety and efficacy in multiple Tc Bovine-derived hIgG product candidates.",
